OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters report multiple
OL,4,Acasualties after Glasgow fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have reported "multiple
OL,7,Fcasualties" after they attended a fire
OL,8,Fin Glasgow.
OL,10,FFour fire engines were sent after
OL,11,Freports of a fire on the ground floor
OL,12,Fof a four-storey building on Copland
OL,13,FRoad in the Ibrox area just after
OL,14,F17:00.
OL,16,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,17,F(SFRS) said casualties were passed into
OL,18,Fthe care of paramedics, but gave no
OL,19,Ffurther details of their condition.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
